Sitting around the big wooden table, listening to captivating stories of adventure, I was completely engrossed. Then, unexpectedly, a towering, muscular man at the far end of the bar began recounting his own grand adventures. His braggadocious narrative drew me in with each boastful detail. I couldn't help but chuckle silently at his youthful overstatements, feeling like I was part of a humorous tale. As he continued, my smile grew wider until I was thoroughly entertained by his yarn."},{"id":"T4","text":"I have never understood why people want to get drunk every night. All the courage in the world can’t change the fact that the next morning you’re a broken man. But I’m not perfect, and I admit that I was a poor judge of character the night before. I was too distracted by all the fascinating stories being told around the big wooden table, when suddenly a tall, stout man at the end of the bar suddenly began to tell us an epic story of adventure. With every boastful word I grew more interested, I felt as if I were in the middle of a story, and I was the only one who didn’t laugh at the man’s childish exaggerations. The more he talked, the more I smiled, and soon I was completely engrossed in the story."}]}

